"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu h-6 w-6\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg><span class=\"sr-only\">Toggle menu</span></button></div></nav><section class=\"pt-[7.5rem] pb-20 px-4\"><div class=\"container mx-auto text-center\"><h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold mb-6\">Complete Quests. <span class=\"text-accent\">Earn Rewards</span></h1><p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl mb-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto opacity-80\">Season 2 is live. Complete quests, earn rewards, and level up in a fresh earning season.</p><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-[#222] text-primary-foreground hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground h-11 rounded-md text-lg px-8 py-6\" href=\"/signin\">Get Started</a></div></section><section class=\"py-20 px-4 bg-card\"><div class=\"container mx-auto\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-12 text-center\">How It Works</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"relative bg-background rounded-lg border border-border transition-all duration-500 cursor-pointer hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-accent/10 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-accent/30\" style=\"perspective:1000px;height:280px;width:100%\"><div class=\"card-inner w-full h-full relative transition-transform duration-700 \" style=\"transform-style:preserve-3d\"><div class=\"card-front absolute w-full h-full backface-hidden flex flex-col items-center p-8\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-accent/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-6 mx-auto\"><span class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-accent\">1</span></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-center\">Sign Up</h3><p class=\"text-center opacity-80\">Create your account and join the Cedomis community.</p></div><div class=\"card-back absolute w-full h-full backface-hidden flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-6 overflow-hidden\" style=\"transform:rotateY(180deg)\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-center text-accent\">Sign Up Details</h3><p class=\"text-center text-sm\">Creating an account is simple and free. Just provide your email address and create a password. Once verified, you&#x27;ll have access to all quests and campaigns on the platform.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"relative bg-background rounded-lg border border-border transition-all duration-500 cursor-pointer hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-accent/10 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-accent/30\" style=\"perspective:1000px;height:280px;width:100%\"><div class=\"card-inner w-full h-full relative transition-transform duration-700 \" style=\"transform-style:preserve-3d\"><div class=\"card-front absolute w-full h-full backface-hidden flex flex-col items-center p-8\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-accent/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-6 mx-auto\"><span class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-accent\">2</span></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-center\">Complete Quests</h3><p class=\"text-center opacity-80\">Participate in various quests and campaigns to earn Rewards.</p></div><div class=\"card-back absolute w-full h-full backface-hidden flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-6 overflow-hidden\" style=\"transform:rotateY(180deg)\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-center text-accent\">Quest Details</h3><p class=\"text-center text-sm\">Browse available quests and select ones that interest you. Each quest has specific tasks to complete and rewards to earn. Track your progress in your dashboard and submit proof of completion when finished.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"relative bg-background rounded-lg border border-border transition-all duration-500 cursor-pointer hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-accent/10 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-accent/30\" style=\"perspective:1000px;height:280px;width:100%\"><div class=\"card-inner w-full h-full relative transition-transform duration-700 \" style=\"transform-style:preserve-3d\"><div class=\"card-front absolute w-full h-full backface-hidden flex flex-col items-center p-8\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-accent/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-6 mx-auto\"><span class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-accent\">3</span></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-center\">Level Up</h3><p class=\"text-center opacity-80\">Earn points, level up, and unlock exclusive rewards.</p></div><div class=\"card-back absolute w-full h-full backface-hidden flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-6 overflow-hidden\" style=\"transform:rotateY(180deg)\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-center text-accent\">Rewards Details</h3><p class=\"text-center text-sm\">As you complete quests, you&#x27;ll earn points that contribute to your level. Higher levels unlock exclusive rewards, special quests, and community recognition. Earn CEDO, ARENA, PCedo, or partnered tokens.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 px-4\"><div class=\"container mx-auto text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6\">Ready to Start Your Journey?</h2><p class=\"text-xl mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto opacity-80\">Join thousands of users already completing quests on Cedomis.</p></div></section><footer class=\"py-2.5 px-4 border-t border-border\"><div class=\"md:container mx-auto\"><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap mb-3 md:mb-0\"><img alt=\"Cedomis Logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"30\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-8 w-auto\" style=\"color:transparent\